      "id": "xuhb122ijbtqkri3h6er2m21y",
      "title": "OpenAI 请外部专家核查其 AI 在数学、计算机科学和物理学领域产出的证明",
      "title_en": "OpenAI asks outside experts, including a Nobel laureate, to check proofs its AI produced in math, computer science, and physics",
      "url": "https://the-decoder.com/openai-asks-outside-experts-including-a-nobel-laureate-to-check-proofs-its-ai-produced-in-math-computer-science-and-physics/",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/xuhb122ijbtqkri3h6er2m21y",
      "source": "The Decoder：AI News（RSS）",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T12:37:24.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-10-27T13:01:41.236Z",
      "summary": "The Decoder 报道 OpenAI 请外部专家担任\"shepherds\"核查其 AI 在计算机科学、数学和物理学领域的三项证明结果，并将部分证明翻译成 Lean 供计算机逐步验证。",
