      "fullContent": "X 上的 Tibo：“Day 22/ Terra is back!\nOur first model that is significantly better at writing, personality and nuanced understanding of requests.\nPacks a punch across the board, very good at computer use, and gives 2X more usage than 6.1 Sol across API and subscriptions.” / X\n发帖\n登录 注册\n发帖\n登录 注册\nX 上的 Tibo：“Day 22/ Terra is back!\nOur first model that is significantly better at writing, personality and nuanced understanding of requests.\nPacks a punch across the board, very good at computer use, and gives 2X more usage than 6.1 Sol across API and subscriptions.”\nTibo\n@thsottiaux\n显示翻译\nDay 22/ Terra is back!\nOur first model that is significantly better at writing, personality and nuanced understanding of requests.\nPacks a punch across the board, very good at computer use, and gives 2X more usage than 6.1 Sol across API and subscriptions.\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n10月26日\nGPT-6.1 Terra: delivering fast and capable computer use at a lower price.\nGPT-6.1 Terra understands what’s on screen, takes action across apps, writes naturally, and is a more capable model for your whole workday with the efficiency to take on more of it.\n00:00\n19:24 · 2026年10月26日 · 179.3万\n浏览量\n2713\n868\n1万\n736\nTibo\n@thsottiaux\n显示翻译\nDay 22/ Terra is back!\nOur first model that is significantly better at writing, personality and nuanced understanding of requests.\nPacks a punch across the board, very good at computer use, and gives 2X more usage than 6.1 Sol across API and subscriptions.\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n10月26日\nGPT-6.1 Terra: delivering fast and capable computer use at a lower price.\nGPT-6.1 Terra understands what’s on screen, takes action across apps, writes naturally, and is a more capable model for your whole workday with the efficiency to take on more of it.\n00:00\n19:24 · 2026年10月26日 · 179.3万\n浏览量\n2713\n868\n1万\n736\nEntinode\n@Entinode\n10月26日\nAre you OK?\nWe need BETTER models, NOT WORSE models.\nWtf...\n50\n5\n2214\n16万\nRez\n@RezAIT00\n10月26日\nBut why? Where