      "tag": "AI动态",
      "tagClass": "tag-neutral",
      "fullContent": "What’s new in Gamma | September–October 2026 | Gamma Changelog\nGamma\nLog in Sign up\nHome\nFeedback\nFeedback\nChangelog\n←\nBack to changelog Powered by Canny\nIntroducing Gamma 5\nWe rebuilt how Gamma thinks, designs, and edits. Because your best ideas deserve better. Give Gamma 5 whatever you have: a sentence, a doc, a PDF, an image, an old deck. The agent will then brainstorm, research, and design a polished presentation within minutes. Bring in PDF and PPT designs for ongoing use. Edit however you'd like, then export - your changes stay intact. Skip the copy-and-paste. Connect Slack, Notion, Granola, and 20+ other tools to bring in context directly. Gamma builds the story around your data. Describe the look you want, or share visual inspiration. Gamma tailors a style to your goal, so the result is specific to your content, not generic.\nClearer credit balances\nCheck your balance more easily from your home screen and Billing settings, with clearer credit information and an out-of-credits state. Learn how credits work.\nExports that stay closer to your design\nPowerPoint exports better preserve custom fonts in multilingual text, equations, and table emoji and layouts. Tall charts in classic Gammas also fit PowerPoint and Google Slides more reliably when Scale to fit is enabled. Explore export options.\nPreviews that match your format\nNew and updated Gammas now show previews that better reflect their format, including portrait documents, social posts, and 4:3 slides. Older previews refresh after you edit the Gamma, making your work easier to recognize across your library and templates."
