      "id": "o0okltd585bcx5lh6bkq53n59",
      "title": "Apple 发布搭载 M6 芯片的 14 英寸 MacBook Pro，起售价 $1,999",
      "title_en": "Apple introduces the new 14-inch MacBook Pro with M6",
      "url": "https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/10/apple-introduces-the-new-14-inch-macbook-pro-with-m6/",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/o0okltd585bcx5lh6bkq53n59",
