      "fullContent": "X 上的 OpenRouter：“Kimi K3.1 Pro from @Kimi_Moonshot is live on OpenRouter.\nA 1M context, multimodal open-weight model, post-trained from Kimi K3 for long-horizon coding and agentic work. $2/M input tokens, $10/M output tokens.\nTry it: https://t.co/XuXKudfdyw” / X\n发帖\n登录 注册\n发帖\n登录 注册\nX 上的 OpenRouter：“Kimi K3.1 Pro from @Kimi_Moonshot is live on OpenRouter.\nA 1M context, multimodal open-weight model, post-trained from Kimi K3 for long-horizon coding and agentic work. $2/M input tokens, $10/M output tokens.\nTry it: https://t.co/XuXKudfdyw”\nOpenRouter\n@OpenRouter\n显示翻译\nKimi K3.1 Pro from @Kimi_Moonshot is live on OpenRouter.\nA 1M context, multimodal open-weight model, post-trained from Kimi K3 for long-horizon coding and agentic work. $2/M input tokens, $10/M output tokens.\nTry it: openrouter.ai/moonshotai/kim…\nKimi.ai\n@Kimi_Moonshot\n10月23日\nIntroducing Kimi K3.1 Pro: our most capable 3T-class open-weight model.\n🔹 1M-token context, 2.8T total / 104B active params (MoE), Multimodal.\n🔹 Full-project coding: games in Unreal, Unity & Godot.\n🔹 Excels at parametric 3D modeling in Blender & CAD.\n🔹 More reliable at\n18:31 · 2026年10月23日 · 1.9万\n浏览量\n37\n19\n386\n27\nOpenRouter\n@OpenRouter\n显示翻译\nKimi K3.1 Pro from @Kimi_Moonshot is live on OpenRouter.\nA 1M context, multimodal open-weight model, post-trained from Kimi K3 for long-horizon coding and agentic work. $2/M input tokens, $10/M output tokens.\nTry it: openrouter.ai/moonshotai/kim…\nKimi.ai\n@Kimi_Moonshot\n10月23日\nIntroducing Kimi K3.1 Pro: our most capable 3T-class open-weight model.\n🔹 1M-token context, 2.8T total / 104B active params (MoE), Multimodal.\n🔹 Full-project coding: games in Unreal, Unity & Godot.\n🔹 Excels at parametric 3D modeling in Blender & CAD.\n🔹 More reliable at\n18:31 · 2026年10月23日 · 1.9万\n浏览量\n37\n19\n386\n27\nOpenRouter\n@OpenRouter\n10月23日\nMoonshot reports 65.7% on Terminal-Bench 4.0, next to Claude Opus 5.5 (66.4%) and ahead of GPT-6 Astra (58.2%). On its Kimi Code Bench 3.0 Long-horizon, K3.1 Pro scores 61.2%, up from K3's 55.95%.\n3\n1\n14\n4778\nOpenRouter\n@OpenRouter\n10月23日\nKimi K3.1 Pro Highspeed is live too: 2-3x faster, at $4/M input and $20/M output. Pick it from the providers list on the model page.\nSee more:\nKimi K3.1 Pro - API Pricing & Providers\n自 openrouter.ai\n11\n3379\nSteven Cheng\n@stevencheng\n10月23日\nHow's the Blender parametric modeling actually\n3\n143"
