      "id": "w7axcg0e1y7uoyro92cmanong",
      "title": "The Verge 分析 SpaceX 与特斯拉成立特别委员会讨论合并背后的财务逻辑",
      "title_en": "Sure, let’s smoosh SpaceX and Tesla together, who cares",
      "url": "https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1016879/spacex-tesla-cursed-katamari",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/w7axcg0e1y7uoyro92cmanong",
      "source": "The Verge：AI（RSS）",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T19:45:00.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-10-22T21:11:19.229Z",
      "summary": "The Verge 作者 Elizabeth Lopatto 分析 SpaceX 和 Tesla 各自成立特别委员会讨论合并一事。",
      "category": "c6",
      "score": 79,
      "selected": true,
      "attribution": {
