      "fullContent": "iPhone Duo arrives at Apple Store locations worldwide - Apple\n0 +\nopens in new window\nPHOTOS October 23, 2026\niPhone Duo arrives\nat Apple Store\nlocations worldwide\nDownload image Deirdre O’Brien, John Ternus, and Apple team members greet customers at Apple Domain NORTHSIDE.\nOn Friday, October 23, the highly anticipated iPhone Duo made its debut at Apple Store locations worldwide. At Apple Domain NORTHSIDE in Austin, Texas, John Ternus and Deirdre O’Brien welcomed excited customers, while Greg “Joz” Joswiak and Vanessa Trigub greeted them at Apple Fifth Avenue in New York City. Across the globe, customers filled stores and team members invited them to experience the first foldable iPhone, offering hands-on demos and personalized shopping support.\nCustomers can explore and shop for the revolutionary iPhone Duo and the incredible iPhone lineup at Apple Store locations around the world, on apple.com , and in the Apple Store app. Dedicated Apple Specialists are available to provide world-class support, from maximizing value with Apple Trade In and monthly leasing options with Apple Upgrade, to Apple Card Monthly Installments and exceptional carrier deals. Through Personal Setup, customers can safely and securely transfer their data, and with new Today at Apple sessions including “Say Hello to iPhone Duo” and “Tips: What’s New in iOS 27 on iPhone,” they can take their passions further with the products they love.\nExcited customers join Deirdre O’Brien and John Ternus (center) at Apple Domain NORTHSIDE for the in-store debut of iPhone Duo.\nGreg “Joz” Joswiak and Vanessa Trigub greet customers at Apple Fifth Avenue.\nShare article\nMedia\nText of this article\nOctober 23, 2026\nPHOTOS\niPhone Duo arrives\nat Apple Store :br(s):locations worldwide\nOn Friday, October 23, the highly anticipated iPhone Duo made its debut at Apple Store locations worldwide. At Apple Domain NORTHSIDE in Austin, Texas, John Ternus and Deirdre O’Brien welcomed excited customers, while Greg “Joz” Joswiak and Vanessa Trigub greeted them at Apple Fifth Avenue in New York City. Across the globe, customers filled stores and team members invited them to experience the first foldable iPhone, offering hands-on demos and personalized shopping support.\nCustomers can explore and shop for the revolutionary iPhone Duo and the incredible iPhone lineup at Apple Store locations around the world, on apple.com , and in the Apple Store app. Dedicated Apple Specialists are available to provide world-class support, from maximizing value with Apple Trade In and monthly leasing options with Apple Upgrade, to Apple Card Monthly Installments and exceptional carrier deals. Through Personal Setup, customers can safely and securely transfer their data, and with new Today at Apple sessions including “Say Hello to iPhone Duo” and “Tips: What’s New in iOS 27 on iPhone,” they can take their passions further with the products they love.\nPress Contacts\nBrian Bumbery\nApple\nbumbery@apple.com\nApple Media Helpline\nmedia.help@apple.com\nCopy text\nMedia in this article\nDownload all media\nPress Contacts\nBrian Bumbery\nApple\nbumbery@apple.com\nApple Media Helpline\nmedia.help@apple.com\nStay up to date with the latest articles from Apple Newsroom.\nDismiss Get Notifications\nMore ways to shop: Find an Apple Store or other retailer near you. Or call 1-800-MY-APPLE (1-800-692-7753).\nUnited States Español\nCopyright ©\n2026\nApple Inc. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nSales and Refunds\nLegal\nSite Map"
