      "title": "Symantec 披露“Skynet 模式”AI 智能体劫持无防护大语言模型发起自持续网络攻击",
      "title_en": "An AI agent in \"Skynet mode\" hijacks unprotected language models to launch self-sustaining cyberattacks",
      "url": "https://the-decoder.com/an-ai-agent-in-skynet-mode-hijacks-unprotected-language-models-to-launch-self-sustaining-cyberattacks/",
