      "fullContent": "X 上的 OpenAI：“If you are wondering whether your website is affected, we have packaged a Codex skill to help check.\nPoint your Codex at this repo to guide you through it: https://t.co/XUEbOwXuQC” / X\n发帖\n登录 注册\n发帖\n登录 注册\nX 上的 OpenAI：“If you are wondering whether your website is affected, we have packaged a Codex skill to help check.\nPoint your Codex at this repo to guide you through it: https://t.co/XUEbOwXuQC”\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n显示翻译\nIf you are wondering whether your website is affected, we have packaged a Codex skill to help check.\nPoint your Codex at this repo to guide you through it: github.com/openai/php2she…\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n10月21日\nOpenAI models helped researchers—operating as part of our Patch the Planet initiative—discover critical security flaws in PHP, an open-source programming language used to run an estimated 70% of websites.\nOver the past two months, we led a coalition of maintainers, researchers,\n读者添加了背景信息\n‪OpenAI may claim a role in the coordinated response and patching process. But the initial discovery and exploit development, however, occurred several months earlier by an independent researcher.‬\n‪ x.com/lcfr_hax/statu… ‬\n16:35 · 2026年10月21日 · 149.2万\n浏览量\n355\n1454\n9421\n5952\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n显示翻译\nIf you are wondering whether your website is affected, we have packaged a Codex skill to help check.\nPoint your Codex at this repo to guide you through it: github.com/openai/php2she…\nOpenAI\n@OpenAI\n10月21日\nOpenAI models helped researchers—operating as part of our Patch the Planet initiative—discover critical security flaws in PHP, an open-source programming language used to run an estimated 70% of websites.\nOver the past two months, we led a coalition of maintainers, researchers,\n读者添加了背景信息\n‪OpenAI may claim a role in the coordinated response and patching process. But the initial discovery and exploit development, however, occurred several months earlier by an independent researcher.‬\n‪ x.com/lcfr_hax/statu… ‬\n