      "title": "Wiz Research 披露 PHP2Shell：AI 助攻 PHP 核心 RCE 漏洞，影响全球 70% 网站",
      "title_en": "PHP2Shell: AI uncovers critical RCE vulnerabilities affecting 70% of the Internet",
      "url": "https://www.wiz.io/blog/php2shell-php-rce",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/z9nqeyi6p0br6knhkrt3xd3n6",
      "source": "Wiz：Research（安全研究）",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T13:30:59.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-10-21T14:46:55.600Z",
      "summary": "Wiz Research 披露 PHP 核心中的多个内存安全漏洞（CVE-2026-109618/109619，CVSS 最高 9.2），实现无需认证的远程代码执行与内存泄露，影响至少追溯到 PHP 5.4 的近十年版本。",
      "category": "c3",
      "score": 85,
      "selected": true,
      "attribution": {
        "source": "AIHOT",
        "canonical": "https://aihot.news/items/z9nqeyi6p0br6knhkrt3xd3n6"
